    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: center; width: 20%"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Effective
    date</b></span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
