expense. The fair value of <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--FairValueOfShares_iI_pid_c20260331__ifrs-full--CounterpartiesAxis__custom--CFOMember_zvcH1yuMCbI" title="Fair value of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="AEHL:FairValueOfShares" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-31_custom_CFOMember" id="Fact001202" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">13,814</ix:nonFraction></span> shares was $ <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--FairValueOfSharesIssued_c20251001__20260331__ifrs-full--CounterpartiesAxis__custom--CFOMember_zkpp58ZDPG9b" title="Fair value of shares issued value"><ix:nonFraction name="AEHL:FairValueOfSharesIssued" contextRef="From2025-10-012026-03-31_custom_CFOMember" id="Fact001204" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

