October 1, 2025 to March 31, 2026, the Company issued an aggregate of <span id="xdx_902_ecustom--AggregateOfWarrants_iI_pid_c20260331__ifrs-full--CounterpartiesAxis__custom--EmployeesMember_zXnjFFRlDtZh" title="Aggregate of warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="AEHL:AggregateOfWarrants" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-31_custom_EmployeesMember" id="Fact001206" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">145,009</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares to its employees as a Share Compensation expense. The fair value of <span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--FairValueOfShares_iI_pid_c20260331__ifrs-full--CounterpartiesAxis__custom--EmployeesMember_z7O232wHsuS6" title="Fair value of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="AEHL:FairValueOfShares" contextRef="AsOf2026-03-31_custom_EmployeesMember" id="Fact001208" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">145,009</ix:nonFraction></span>
